1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:50,040 --> 00:01:52,210
You protected me for more than 2000 years,

25
00:01:53,160 --> 00:01:54,210
you...

26
00:01:54,360 --> 00:01:55,490
worked hard.

27
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:59,050
I will make you the Sword Spirit of this celestial sword.

28
00:01:58,880 --> 00:02:00,450
In 10 000 years,

29
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:02,490
you will become a Celestial Saint.

30
00:02:31,200 --> 00:02:34,530
Central Fragment
Rain Celestial Realm

31
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:35,730
A Rain Celestial Sword appeared.

32
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:36,690
If I get it,

33
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:38,890
it will improve the strength of planet Tian Mo.

34
00:02:36,320 --> 00:02:39,810
Tian Mozi
Middle stage Nirvana Scryer
Planet Tian Mo

35
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:41,970
I just don't know which Rain Celestial Sword it is...

36
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:44,610
Southwest Fragment
Rain Celestial Realm

37
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:47,130
A celestial sword ?

38
00:02:47,720 --> 00:02:51,670
My beast is able to control the Sword Spirit within the sword.

39
00:02:47,160 --> 00:02:50,730
Ling Tianhou
Late stage Nirvana Cleanser
Da Lou Sword Sect Leader

40
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:55,250
With it, planet Tian Yun will finally be mine.

41
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,530
Brother Chi Hu,

42
00:03:19,320 --> 00:03:20,770
star compass !

43
00:03:31,600 --> 00:03:33,610
Thanks to Brother Ceng,

44
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:35,610
we are out of danger for now.

45
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:37,610
But the star compass is still damaged.

46
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:39,970
I'm afraid it won't take us far enough to cross the void.

47
00:03:40,320 --> 00:03:42,010
The star compass,

48
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:44,090
the treasure of the Giant Demon Clan.

49
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:46,890
Sadly,

50
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:49,130
it's only an imitation.

51
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:52,250
Ceng Niu,

52
00:03:52,540 --> 00:03:54,930
if you agree to release the seal,

53
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:57,730
I can promise to safely return you to planet Suzaku.

54
00:03:58,480 --> 00:04:00,050
How does it sound ?

55
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:11,490
I don't just have 3 souls, but a fourth one as well.

56
00:04:11,320 --> 00:04:14,090
The fourth one is inside the body in the coffin.

57
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:18,290
Senior Zhou Yi never mentioned a fourth soul.

58
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:20,450
He might be lying

59
00:04:20,320 --> 00:04:21,690
so let's probe him.

60
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:24,130
I'm afraid Senior's words

61
00:04:23,960 --> 00:04:25,770
must have some other meaning.

62
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:27,450
Besides, you must already know

63
00:04:27,640 --> 00:04:29,370
that I cannot break

64
00:04:29,440 --> 00:04:31,570
the seal of an Ascendant cultivator.

65
00:04:39,280 --> 00:04:40,490
Alright,

66
00:04:40,520 --> 00:04:42,170
you have some guts.

67
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:44,730
No wonder you are the one Zhou Yi chose.

68
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:46,970
Now come with me right now !

69
00:04:47,320 --> 00:04:48,850
The slave seal is unstable.

70
00:04:48,610 --> 00:04:50,210
Use the pagoda to protect yourself.

71
00:04:53,080 --> 00:04:54,130
Sun Tai,

72
00:04:54,440 --> 00:04:57,090
Senior Zhou Yi specifically made this pagoda

73
00:04:57,320 --> 00:04:59,290
so that it could kill you.

74
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,930
Zhou Yi...

75
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:04,330
I know a little bit

76
00:05:04,320 --> 00:05:06,050
about your Corpse Sect.

77
00:05:06,520 --> 00:05:08,330
The corpse inside the coffin

78
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:10,890
most likely contains someone else's soul.

79
00:05:12,080 --> 00:05:13,970
Even if it's your fourth soul,

80
00:05:13,960 --> 00:05:15,810
it's a broken soul !

81
00:05:16,640 --> 00:05:19,690
I won’t lower myself to deal with a Junior like you !

82
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:23,370
Since he retreated,

83
00:05:23,960 --> 00:05:26,290
the fourth soul must be a lie.

84
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:28,290
He can't take this risk.

85
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:32,010
Brother Ceng,

86
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:33,890
Sun Tai's cultivation is very high.

87
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:35,890
You have to be careful in the future.

88
00:05:36,840 --> 00:05:37,890
Don't worry,

89
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:40,090
Senior Zhou Yi told me that keeping him alive

90
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:42,090
serves a greater purpose.

91
00:05:41,880 --> 00:05:45,650
Otherwise I would have already killed him and his fourth soul.

92
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:53,410
I can't kill him, I can't trap him...

93
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:55,410
He's really troublesome...

94
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:59,730
It seems Zhou Yi intends to use me for something,

95
00:05:59,770 --> 00:06:02,010
I have to find out what it is.

96
00:06:08,840 --> 00:06:10,050
Brother Ceng,

97
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:12,050
this star compass can no longer fly.

98
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:13,890
We will have to fly on our own.

99
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:15,050
Brother Chi Hu,

100
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:17,610
you only brought one star compass ?

101
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,570
This treasure

102
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:21,290
was brought by my clan

103
00:06:21,320 --> 00:06:23,810
when we migrated to Suzaku countless years ago.

104
00:06:23,960 --> 00:06:25,690
But now that it's broken,

105
00:06:26,040 --> 00:06:27,650
I’ll be punished for sure

106
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:29,090
when I get back.

107
00:06:30,840 --> 00:06:31,890
Brother Chi Hu,

108
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:33,880
I won’t lie to you,

109
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:35,410
I can repair this star compass.

110
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:39,690
But the material to repair it is too precious.

111
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:41,490
If I repair it

112
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:43,770
then it must belong to me.

113
00:06:44,640 --> 00:06:46,010
This...

114
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:48,770
Forget it,

115
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:51,210
if it is too difficult for Brother Chi Hu,

116
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:52,450
I’m still willing to fix it for you

117
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:54,850
as a token of our friendship.

118
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:56,650
Is what you’re saying true ?

119
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,770
It is true.

120
00:06:58,400 --> 00:07:01,370
However, I will need this star compass for something in the future,

121
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:03,930
so when I need to borrow it, don’t reject me.

122
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:08,290
With the temperament of my clan's Elders,

123
00:07:08,200 --> 00:07:10,370
there's no way they would lend it to you.

124
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:12,060
That's why

125
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:14,210
I might as well gift it to you !

126
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:19,850
Brother Ceng,

127
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:22,370
this star compass is now yours.

128
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:25,290
Thank you very much.

129
00:07:30,440 --> 00:07:32,610
I will have to ask Brother Chi Hu to protect me.

130
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:46,210
According to Tu Si's memory,

131
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:48,850
a star compass is made of this material.

132
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:01,690
This Ceng Niu

133
00:08:01,560 --> 00:08:04,090
has a shocking cultivation and courage.

134
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:06,610
He also obtained Zhou Yi's Ascendant Crystal.

135
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:08,490
If he becomes a true friend,

136
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:11,810
it will benefit the clan in the future.

137
00:08:27,840 --> 00:08:28,770
Brother Ceng,

138
00:08:28,880 --> 00:08:30,530
are you done repairing it ?

139
00:08:30,960 --> 00:08:33,570
There should be no problems leaving this void.

140
00:08:35,120 --> 00:08:38,490
Central Fragment
Rain Celestial Realm

141
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:42,050
Second Rain Celestial Sword,

142
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:43,210
appear !

143
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:46,930
Second Rain Celestial Sword

144
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:52,250
If the Celestial Realm was still intact,

145
00:08:52,040 --> 00:08:54,170
I would just throw your soul

146
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:56,170
in the Celestial Purification Pond.

147
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:59,850
But now that it's gone, to restore your Origin Soul,

148
00:09:00,160 --> 00:09:02,130
one Rain Celestial Sword

149
00:09:02,520 --> 00:09:03,530
is too slow.

150
00:09:04,800 --> 00:09:05,850
Ting'er,

151
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:07,930
why are you doing all of this ?

152
00:09:07,920 --> 00:09:10,010
Do you want to waste the celestial spiritual energy

153
00:09:09,800 --> 00:09:11,850
I have gathered for you during thousands of years ?

154
00:09:09,440 --> 00:09:11,850
Zhou Yi
Sword Spirit

155
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:13,850
I refuse to let you die,

156
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:15,330
so you will not die.

157
00:09:15,920 --> 00:09:17,330
And my name

158
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:19,730
is not Ting'er.

159
00:09:22,520 --> 00:09:23,770
Sure...

160
00:09:24,520 --> 00:09:26,330
you are not called Ting'er…

161
00:09:27,400 --> 00:09:29,730
I have already remembered everything…

162
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:32,290
However,

163
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:35,690
this name, Ting'er…

164
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:37,590
I like it

165
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:38,690
very much.

166
00:09:50,280 --> 00:09:51,730
They're coming.

167
00:09:57,960 --> 00:09:59,010
That's...

168
00:10:00,520 --> 00:10:01,770
celestial swords ?

169
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:10,050
Where are they coming from ?

170
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:43,690
Third Rain Celestial Sword

171
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:46,890
Celestial swords !

172
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:52,930
They really are celestial swords !

173
00:10:57,680 --> 00:10:58,530
Ting'er,

174
00:10:58,440 --> 00:11:00,450
are 3 Rain Celestial Swords not enough ?

175
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:02,130
It's not enough,

176
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:05,410
the Fourth Rain Celestial Sword will soon take form.

177
00:11:25,560 --> 00:11:27,210
A celestial Qilin...

178
00:11:27,040 --> 00:11:29,170
The Da Lou Sword Sect’s guardian beast !

179
00:11:29,840 --> 00:11:32,130
This beast belongs to Sword Saint Ling Tianhou !

180
00:11:31,880 --> 00:11:33,010
Is he...

181
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:34,690
Welcome Master.

182
00:11:49,840 --> 00:11:51,370
A single glance was enough

183
00:11:51,120 --> 00:11:52,690
to be injured by his sword intent.

184
00:11:53,040 --> 00:11:54,610
This old man's cultivation

185
00:11:54,760 --> 00:11:56,170
is terrifying.

186
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:59,770
Are you a Celestial ?

187
00:11:59,680 --> 00:12:01,050
A Celestial ?!

188
00:12:00,840 --> 00:12:01,970
How can this be ?

189
00:12:02,960 --> 00:12:04,570
Even if she is a Celestial,

190
00:12:04,600 --> 00:12:06,650
there is no way she can match Ling Tianhou.

191
00:12:07,640 --> 00:12:08,610
Stand down !

192
00:12:10,760 --> 00:12:12,890
The Celestial Realm has already collapsed.

193
00:12:12,760 --> 00:12:14,690
If you really are a surviving Celestial,

194
00:12:14,600 --> 00:12:17,930
then this old man wants to try killing a Celestial !

195
00:12:20,840 --> 00:12:21,970
You evil creature,

196
00:12:22,200 --> 00:12:23,660
even your ancestors back then

197
00:12:23,640 --> 00:12:26,570
didn’t dare to act like this before me.

198
00:12:26,680 --> 00:12:28,650
Could it be that you lost

199
00:12:28,520 --> 00:12:31,610
your memory inheritance after the Celestial Realm collapsed ?

200
00:12:42,400 --> 00:12:45,450
So you are a fake beast that never received an inheritance.

201
00:12:51,560 --> 00:12:52,930
You remember now ?

202
00:12:55,520 --> 00:12:56,570
Forget it,

203
00:12:56,880 --> 00:12:58,730
the Celestial Realm is no more

204
00:12:58,520 --> 00:13:00,930
so there is no point in me punishing you.

205
00:13:55,760 --> 00:13:56,850
A single strike

206
00:13:56,640 --> 00:13:58,410
destroyed 2 swords of the Sword Saint.

207
00:13:58,880 --> 00:14:00,490
This Celestial is impressive !

208
00:14:00,440 --> 00:14:02,690
So that's the power of a Celestial.

209
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:03,570
A single strike destroyed both my swords.

210
00:14:03,680 --> 00:14:06,010
Not even the All-Seer could do this.

211
00:14:06,560 --> 00:14:08,530
This woman is not a normal Celestial.

212
00:14:08,880 --> 00:14:11,610
Could she be a Celestial King ?

213
00:14:11,920 --> 00:14:15,850
I won't be able to get a celestial sword today.

214
00:14:18,200 --> 00:14:19,090
Wait...

215
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:21,130
According to the celestial law,

216
00:14:20,990 --> 00:14:23,490
my crime is worthy of destroying my Origin Soul.

217
00:14:23,280 --> 00:14:24,890
But she didn't kill me.

218
00:14:25,240 --> 00:14:27,330
It's not that she doesn’t want to kill me,

219
00:14:27,120 --> 00:14:28,810
she wants to scare me away !

220
00:14:38,840 --> 00:14:40,490
Celestial King,

221
00:14:40,520 --> 00:14:43,610
I want to see how powerful you are !

222
00:14:48,160 --> 00:14:49,210
Ting'er !

223
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:21,090
A Celestial

224
00:15:20,840 --> 00:15:22,490
is only this strong ?

225
00:15:25,240 --> 00:15:26,490
A death aura ?

226
00:15:26,840 --> 00:15:29,210
She doesn't have much time left.

227
00:15:31,440 --> 00:15:35,530
You should give me the celestial swords !

228
00:15:46,160 --> 00:15:47,410
Ting'er !

229
00:15:47,240 --> 00:15:48,610
Let me out of here !

230
00:15:48,640 --> 00:15:50,370
If you use up all your celestial spiritual energy,

231
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:52,090
you will never wake up again !

232
00:15:53,160 --> 00:15:54,650
You can't leave yet.

233
00:16:13,720 --> 00:16:14,690
Sword Spirit,

234
00:16:14,640 --> 00:16:15,410
go !

235
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:39,570
All-Seer,

236
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:41,770
if you keep me from taking the celestial sword,

237
00:16:41,560 --> 00:16:43,290
when I get back

238
00:16:43,440 --> 00:16:45,890
our sects will fight for 1000 years !

239
00:16:45,680 --> 00:16:47,010
The All-Seer ?!

240
00:16:47,280 --> 00:16:49,450
I am the All-Seer.

241
00:16:50,120 --> 00:16:52,050
Since we met, let's make a deal.

242
00:16:52,840 --> 00:16:55,770
The celestial sword belongs to those who are fated to have it.

243
00:16:55,560 --> 00:16:57,090
If you can get it,

244
00:16:57,240 --> 00:16:58,970
then you are fated.

245
00:17:02,800 --> 00:17:04,010
Tian Mozi !

246
00:17:13,720 --> 00:17:15,010
I'm not greedy.

247
00:17:14,760 --> 00:17:16,490
Of the 4 celestial swords,

248
00:17:16,360 --> 00:17:17,610
I’ll only take one.

249
00:17:17,640 --> 00:17:18,610
Goodbye.

250
00:17:19,880 --> 00:17:22,210
You dare to steal from me ?

251
00:17:22,240 --> 00:17:24,530
My Da Lou Sword Sect will wipe your planet Tian Mo !

252
00:17:24,320 --> 00:17:25,890
Sure, I'll be waiting for you.

253
00:17:41,240 --> 00:17:43,450
You can have this sword

254
00:17:43,360 --> 00:17:45,650
but the Sword Spirit is mine.

255
00:17:52,440 --> 00:17:54,370
This sword belongs to me !

256
00:17:55,440 --> 00:17:57,530
This celestial sword lost its Sword Spirit

257
00:17:57,640 --> 00:18:00,130
so it cannot use any of its spells anymore...

258
00:18:00,520 --> 00:18:02,250
Ling Tianhou,

259
00:18:02,160 --> 00:18:05,050
you obtaining this sword is heavenly fate

260
00:18:04,880 --> 00:18:06,890
so I won’t stop you.

261
00:18:06,840 --> 00:18:08,970
But know your own limits…

262
00:18:13,880 --> 00:18:16,010
You don't have much life left in you.

263
00:18:16,320 --> 00:18:18,490
Since you're a Celestial,

264
00:18:18,360 --> 00:18:20,050
I won't kill you.

265
00:18:20,160 --> 00:18:23,250
But I will take the Sword Spirits of the remaining 2 swords !

266
00:18:48,920 --> 00:18:49,970
Ting'er !

267
00:18:49,840 --> 00:18:50,930
Stop !

268
00:18:57,080 --> 00:18:58,170
Ting'er !

269
00:19:27,680 --> 00:19:29,650
Break for me !

270
00:19:40,040 --> 00:19:41,770
Ting'er !!!

271
00:19:41,720 --> 00:19:45,410
I am not the true soul of a Celestial King.

272
00:19:46,320 --> 00:19:50,250
I am a remnant of a soul that was condensed somehow.

273
00:19:51,240 --> 00:19:53,970
But when you ignited your Origin Soul,

274
00:19:54,200 --> 00:19:55,810
I understood.

275
00:19:56,680 --> 00:19:59,370
I was born out of your obsession for me…

276
